{
  "name": "bus-metro-interchange-block",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Road-only block for a bus/metro interchange: a Medium Road spine frontage plus a Basic Road access loop around a plot sized for a Metro Station or Bus Depot and its bus bays. Transit lines and the station/depot building are not part of this template.",
  "geometryStatus": "UNVERIFIED IN GAME",
  "anchor": "anchor = centre of the layout; +z = main axis at angleDeg 0; angleDeg rotates clockwise seen from above (standard CS1 angle convention used by place-building angleDegrees)",
  "roles": {
    "spine": {
      "default": "Medium Road",
      "allowed": [
        "Medium Road",
        "Large Road"
      ]
    },
    "access": {
      "default": "Basic Road",
      "allowed": [
        "Basic Road"
      ]
    }
  },
  "nodes": {
    "Spine_W": {
      "x": -200,
      "z": -120,
      "elevation": 0
    },
    "Spine_E": {
      "x": 200,
      "z": -120,
      "elevation": 0
    },
    "Loop_NW": {
      "x": -80,
      "z": -120,
      "elevation": 0
    },
    "Loop_NE": {
      "x": 80,
      "z": -120,
      "elevation": 0
    },
    "Loop_SE": {
      "x": 80,
      "z": 60,
      "elevation": 0
    },
    "Loop_SW": {
      "x": -80,
      "z": 60,
      "elevation": 0
    },
    "Spine_W_Loop_NW_s0_i1": {
      "x": -140.0,
      "z": -120.0,
      "elevation": 0.0
    },
    "Loop_NW_Loop_NE_s1_i1": {
      "x": 0.0,
      "z": -120.0,
      "elevation": 0.0
    },
    "Loop_NE_Spine_E_s2_i1": {
      "x": 140.0,
      "z": -120.0,
      "elevation": 0.0
    },
    "Loop_NE_Loop_SE_s3_i1": {
      "x": 80.0,
      "z": -30.0,
      "elevation": 0.0
    },
    "Loop_SE_Loop_SW_s4_i1": {
      "x": 0.0,
      "z": 60.0,
      "elevation": 0.0
    },
    "Loop_SW_Loop_NW_s5_i1": {
      "x": -80.0,
      "z": -30.0,
      "elevation": 0.0
    }
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "from": "Spine_W",
      "to": "Spine_W_Loop_NW_s0_i1",
      "role": "spine",
      "name": "spine approach west"
    },
    {
      "from": "Spine_W_Loop_NW_s0_i1",
      "to": "Loop_NW",
      "role": "spine",
      "name": "spine approach west"
    },
    {
      "from": "Loop_NW",
      "to": "Loop_NW_Loop_NE_s1_i1",
      "role": "spine",
      "name": "spine frontage (station entrance side)"
    },
    {
      "from": "Loop_NW_Loop_NE_s1_i1",
      "to": "Loop_NE",
      "role": "spine",
      "name": "spine frontage (station entrance side)"
    },
    {
      "from": "Loop_NE",
      "to": "Loop_NE_Spine_E_s2_i1",
      "role": "spine",
      "name": "spine approach east"
    },
    {
      "from": "Loop_NE_Spine_E_s2_i1",
      "to": "Spine_E",
      "role": "spine",
      "name": "spine approach east"
    },
    {
      "from": "Loop_NE",
      "to": "Loop_NE_Loop_SE_s3_i1",
      "role": "access",
      "name": "access loop east side"
    },
    {
      "from": "Loop_NE_Loop_SE_s3_i1",
      "to": "Loop_SE",
      "role": "access",
      "name": "access loop east side"
    },
    {
      "from": "Loop_SE",
      "to": "Loop_SE_Loop_SW_s4_i1",
      "role": "access",
      "name": "access loop south side (bus bays front here)"
    },
    {
      "from": "Loop_SE_Loop_SW_s4_i1",
      "to": "Loop_SW",
      "role": "access",
      "name": "access loop south side (bus bays front here)"
    },
    {
      "from": "Loop_SW",
      "to": "Loop_SW_Loop_NW_s5_i1",
      "role": "access",
      "name": "access loop west side"
    },
    {
      "from": "Loop_SW_Loop_NW_s5_i1",
      "to": "Loop_NW",
      "role": "access",
      "name": "access loop west side"
    }
  ],
  "footprint": {
    "minX": -220,
    "maxX": 220,
    "minZ": -140,
    "maxZ": 80
  },
  "notes": [
    "the plot inside the loop (x -80..80, z -120..60) is sized for a mid-size station/depot footprint; measure the actual prefab footprint before placing (facilities[].width/length per docs/api.md GET /state/facilities) and widen the loop if it doesn't fit.",
    "after stamping, place the Metro Station or Bus Depot building against the spine frontage edge (Loop_NW-Loop_NE) and route bus stops along the south side of the access loop (Loop_SE-Loop_SW), per knowledge.md Public transit 'each direction needs a stop, both sides of the street'.",
    "no elevation/grade concerns: every node is at elevation 0."
  ]
}